      "level": 2,
      "content": "12.1 Odisha Legislature"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The state administration of Odisha encompasses legislative, executive, judicial, and local governance divisions.",
        "The executive organ of the state includes the constitutional roles of the Governor and the Chief Minister.",
        "The High Court of Odisha acts as the apex judicial authority within the state.",
        "Local self-governance across the state is established via the Panchayati Raj system across all 30 districts."
      ],
      "id": "xhae077"
